{"about_the_game":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Hexagod is a minimalist roguelike village builder where you place hexagon tiles, manage resources, and command your villagers.</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\">Build a Village from Nothing<br><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3059390/extras/Timeplapse.gif?t=1743265636\" /></h2><h2 class=\"bb_tag\">Place Hexagod Tiles</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><i>  </i><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3059390/extras/Tile_placment.gif?t=1743265636\" /></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\">Care for your Villagers<br><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3059390/extras/Villager.gif?t=1743265636\" /><br>Min/Max Tile Adjacency Bonuses<br><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3059390/extras/Random_Islands.gif?t=1743265636\" /><br><br>Features</h2><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Cute villagers you take care of and place around your village</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Hexagon tile placement with strategic depth</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Unique runs with a variety of random events and procedurally generated game boards</p></li></ul>","background":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/3059390?t=1743265636","background_raw":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/3059390?t=1743265636","capsule_image":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3059390/bcd54fe46bbb6d4ce9dc5651299bbc3c3515226f/capsule_231x87.jpg?t=1743265636","capsule_imagev5":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3059390/bcd54fe46bbb6d4ce9dc5651299bbc3c3515226f/capsule_184x69.jpg?t=1743265636","categories":[{"description":"Single-player","id":2},{"description":"Full controller support","id":28},{"description":"Steam Cl